Rem A floppy image (ADF) as a disk: its label, files over 72 blocks, the disk's own directory order, write protection, the library, taking it out (host only)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Wait 100
Print #1,"game";Drive("Game:");Drive("df0:")
Open In 2,"Game:Readme" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,B$
Open In 2,"df0:S/startup-sequence" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,B$
Open In 2,"game:libs/deep/NOTE.TXT" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,B$
Open In 2,"Game:Big.bin" : Print #1,"big";Lof(2) : S=0 : For I=1 To 100000 : S=S+Asc(Input$(2,1)) : Next I : Close 2 : Print #1,"sum";S
A$=Dir First$("Game:") : While A$<>"" : Print #1,"[";A$;"]" : A$=Dir Next$ : Wend
Trap Open Out 2,"Game:new.txt" : Print #1,"write";Errtrap
Wait 100
Open In 2,"Ofs:hello.txt" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,B$
Open In 2,"Utility:note.txt" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2 : Print #1,B$
Wait 100
Print #1,"out";Exist("df0:Readme");Drive("df0:");Drive("Game:")
Print #1,"end"
